{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "38348554",
      "title": "Introducing the Second Project",
      "sourceHash": "9633a39e79ea9c306299405e551f2eda9192e6f4cd274843d1743f24602d4da9",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 3.42,
          "en": "So at this point,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.42,
          "end": 6.93,
          "en": "we completed the first practice project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.93,
          "end": 10.984,
          "en": "We built the first demo application in this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.984,
          "end": 12.39,
          "en": "But as mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.39,
          "end": 15.122,
          "en": "there will be two projects in this section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.122,
          "end": 17.4,
          "en": "so that you have more opportunities",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.4,
          "end": 19.17,
          "en": "to practice what you learn.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.17,
          "end": 22.26,
          "en": "Now the next demo project we're going to build",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.26,
          "end": 24.06,
          "en": "doesn't look too fancy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.06,
          "end": 28.17,
          "en": "but will actually come with a couple of nice features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.17,
          "end": 32.01,
          "en": "which again allow you to practice building components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.01,
          "end": 35.91,
          "en": "managing state, output and conditional content, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.91,
          "end": 37.423,
          "en": "Because in this demo application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.423,
          "end": 42.21,
          "en": "users will be able to enter some data about them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.21,
          "end": 44.824,
          "en": "to be precise, their username and age,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.824,
          "end": 46.946,
          "en": "and then once the data is confirmed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.946,
          "end": 51.9,
          "en": "the user list is updated and output below the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.9,
          "end": 54.938,
          "en": "But for example, if you enter invalid data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.938,
          "end": 57.45,
          "en": "by submitting an empty form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.45,
          "end": 60.24,
          "en": "an error model is shown instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.24,
          "end": 63.78,
          "en": "So this overlay with an error message is shown instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.78,
          "end": 66.117,
          "en": "And this overlay can then also be closed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.117,
          "end": 69.271,
          "en": "by clicking the okay button or on the backdrop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.271,
          "end": 71.988,
          "en": "This overlay should also not just open up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.988,
          "end": 75.18,
          "en": "if no data was entered, but for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.18,
          "end": 77.82,
          "en": "also if an invalid age was entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.82,
          "end": 79.488,
          "en": "To be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 79.488,
          "end": 81.66,
          "en": "if a number smaller than zero was entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.66,
          "end": 83.55,
          "en": "If valid data is entered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.55,
          "end": 86.542,
          "en": "another user is added to the list though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.542,
          "end": 89.58,
          "en": "So this is the next demo project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.58,
          "end": 91.245,
          "en": "And for this project here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.245,
          "end": 95.55,
          "en": "you therefore essentially have the following tasks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.55,
          "end": 98.72999999999999,
          "en": "You should start by building some core components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.72999999999999,
          "end": 103.72999999999999,
          "en": "For example, add user component, which contains this form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.61699999999999,
          "end": 107.31,
          "en": "You should then, of course, also, again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.31,
          "end": 109.28999999999999,
          "en": "start managing some state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 109.28999999999999,
          "end": 112.59,
          "en": "like that list of users, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.59,
          "end": 116.28,
          "en": "And you should of course also output that list of users,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.28,
          "end": 119.22,
          "en": "and also if needed, this error model,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.22,
          "end": 121.29,
          "en": "which should be shown conditionally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.29,
          "end": 123.304,
          "en": "if invalid data was entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 123.304,
          "end": 127.71,
          "en": "to give the user who's using this website some feedback.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.71,
          "end": 129.51,
          "en": "Now attached to the next lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129.51,
          "end": 131.58,
          "en": "you'll find a new starting project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.58,
          "end": 133.71,
          "en": "which you can use as a starting point.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 133.71,
          "end": 136.696,
          "en": "But this will then be a pretty empty project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 136.696,
          "end": 139.687,
          "en": "because in this upcoming exercise here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 139.687,
          "end": 143.052,
          "en": "unlike in the previous exercise in this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 143.052,
          "end": 147.6,
          "en": "I want you to try to really build everything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 147.6,
          "end": 148.75900000000001,
          "en": "from the ground up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 148.75900000000001,
          "end": 151.62,
          "en": "And therefore, of course, chances are high",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.62,
          "end": 153.06,
          "en": "that you are going to come up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 153.06,
          "end": 156.57,
          "en": "with a pretty different solution than I'll do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 156.57,
          "end": 158.316,
          "en": "But that's absolutely fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 158.316,
          "end": 159.87,
          "en": "This section here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 159.87,
          "end": 162.708,
          "en": "is about practicing what you learned, after all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 162.708,
          "end": 166.087,
          "en": "and nonetheless, starting in the next lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 166.087,
          "end": 170.22,
          "en": "I will show you my possible solution step by step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 170.22,
          "end": 173.18099999999998,
          "en": "and I will show you how I solved these tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 173.18099999999998,
          "end": 175.833,
          "en": "and built this demo project.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}